# Laravel — Interfaces / Application / UI

## Controller

`App\Interfaces\Http\Controllers\Admin\*`. Shim `App\Http\Controllers\Admin\*` só até o port.

FormRequest → UseCase → view/redirect. Sem Eloquent.

## UseCase

Verbo + substantivo (`ListBeneficiarios`, `SaveBeneficiario`). Depende de `*RepositoryInterface`, não de Model.

Binding no `AppServiceProvider`.

## Rotas (espelho Cake)

`/admin/{controller}`, `/view/{id}`, `/add/{id?}` (add = create e edit). Middleware `auth` + tenant + `modulo:{controller}`.

ACL (`perfil_modulo.permissao`, legado AppController): **0** bloqueia · **1** lê (`index`/`view`) · **2** grava (`add`/`edit`) · **3** exclui. Root (`usuario.id == 1`) bypass perm=3.

## UI (legado SmartAdmin / Bootstrap 3)

Layout: `resources/views/layouts/admin.blade.php`. **Não** introduzir BS4/5.

Skeleton obrigatório (copiar do `.ctp`):

```
#ribbon > .breadcrumb
#widget-grid > .row > article.col-xs-12
  .jarviswidget.jarviswidget-color-blue  (preservar id="wid-id-*")
    header > .widget-icon + h2
    form.smart-form.client-form  (filtros / cadastro)
    table / widget-body
```

Preservar IDs, classes e hooks JS do `.ctp` (`form_ajax`, `input_login`, `*_mask`, `btn-ribbon`).
